Rules basis: Rules Cyclopedia-inspired

Armor Class:
- Ascending AC

Attack:
- d20 + attack bonus >= AC

Damage:
- Weapon damage roll + applicable modifier

Initiative:
- Keep simple initially
- d6 per side or individual initiative

Hit Points:
- Fighter uses d8
- Monster uses its normal HD concept

Death:
- 0 HP = defeated

First playable classes:
- Fighter only

First monster:
- Goblin